# The release source tarball carries only the release solution (src + tests),
# the build metadata and the licence files. Local benchmarks and experiments,
# planning, CI and editor files are never packaged. `git archive` honours these
# export-ignore patterns; the directory patterns (without `/**`) drop the empty
# directory entry that `/**` alone would leave.
/.config        export-ignore
/.config/**     export-ignore
/.github        export-ignore
/.github/**     export-ignore
/benchmarks     export-ignore
/benchmarks/**  export-ignore
/experiments    export-ignore
/experiments/** export-ignore
/artifacts      export-ignore
/artifacts/**   export-ignore
AGENTS.md       export-ignore
.gitignore      export-ignore
.gitattributes  export-ignore
